    {"type":"text","id":"tier1_t","x":982,"y":189,"width":456,"height":44,"text":"Tier 1 · 단기(컨텍스트):  대화 history (토큰 제한, 초과 시 trajectory 압축·요약)","originalText":"t1","fontSize":13,"fontFamily":3,"textAlign":"left","verticalAlign":"middle","strokeColor":"#374151","backgroundColor":"transparent","fillStyle":"solid","strokeWidth":1,"strokeStyle":"solid","roughness":0,"opacity":100,"angle":0,"seed":310043,"version":1,"versionNonce":1,"isDeleted":false,"groupIds":[],"boundElements":null,"link":null,"locked":false,"containerId":"tier1","lineHeight":1.4},
    {"type":"rectangle","id":"tier2","x":970,"y":259,"width":480,"height":90,"strokeColor":"#047857","backgroundColor":"#d1fae5","fillStyle":"solid","strokeWidth":2,"strokeStyle":"solid","roughness":0,"opacity":100,"angle":0,"seed":310044,"version":1,"versionNonce":1,"isDeleted":false,"groupIds":[],"boundElements":[{"id":"tier2_t","type":"text"}],"link":null,"locked":false,"roundness":{"type":3}},
    {"type":"text","id":"tier2_t","x":982,"y":273,"width":456,"height":62,"text":"Tier 2 · 영속(바운디드):  MEMORY.md(에이전트 노트) · USER.md(유저 모델).\n세션 시작 때 스냅샷을 시스템 프롬프트에 freeze → 세션 중 불변 (prefix cache 보존).\n디스크 기록은 즉시, 프롬프트 반영은 다음 세션부터.","originalText":"t2","fontSize":12,"fontFamily":3,"textAlign":"left","verticalAlign":"middle","strokeColor":"#374151","backgroundColor":"transparent","fillStyle":"solid","strokeWidth":1,"strokeStyle":"solid","roughness":0,"opacity":100,"angle":0,"seed":310045,"version":1,"versionNonce":1,"isDeleted":false,"groupIds":[],"boundElements":null,"link":null,"locked":false,"containerId":"tier2","lineHeight":1.4},
    {"type":"rectangle","id":"tier3","x":970,"y":361,"width":480,"height":96,"strokeColor":"#6d28d9","backgroundColor":"#ede9fe","fillStyle":"solid","strokeWidth":2,"strokeStyle":"solid","roughness":0,"opacity":100,"angle":0,"seed":310046,"version":1,"versionNonce":1,"isDeleted":false,"groupIds":[],"boundElements":[{"id":"tier3_t","type":"text"}],"link":null,"locked":false,"roundness":{"type":3}},
    {"type":"text","id":"tier3_t","x":982,"y":375,"width":456,"height":68,"text":"Tier 3 · 외부 프로바이더 (택1, 플러그인):\n· Honcho — dialectic Q&A 로 유저 모델 자가치유\n· Holographic — HRR 위상벡터 + FTS5 + trust 점수 (로컬 SQLite)\n· Hindsight / Mem0 / OpenViking …","originalText":"t3","fontSize":12,"fontFamily":3,"textAlign":"left","verticalAlign":"middle","strokeColor":"#4c1d95","backgroundColor":"transparent","fillStyle":"solid","strokeWidth":1,"strokeStyle":"solid","roughness":0,"opacity":100,"angle":0,"seed":310047,"version":1,"versionNonce":1,"isDeleted":false,"groupIds":[],"boundElements":null,"link":null,"locked":false,"containerId":"tier3","lineHeight":1.4},
    {"type":"text","id":"p_note","x":970,"y":475,"width":485,"height":150,"text":"회상(RAG):  매 턴 전 prefetch_all(query) 로 모든 프로바이더에서 컨텍스트 수집 → <memory-context> 펜스로 감싸 주입.\n매 턴 후 sync_all() 은 백그라운드 스레드에서 영속화(턴을 막지 않음).\n\nSOUL.md = 에이전트 페르소나(정적, 사용자 편집).\n세션 검색 = state.db FTS5 로 과거 대화 전문검색 + LLM 요약 → 세션 간 컨텍스트 복구.\n\nprovenance: 큐레이터는 background_review 가 만든 스킬만 자동 관리.\n사용자 지정 스킬은 건드리지 않음.","originalText":"n","fontSize":12,"fontFamily":3,"textAlign":"left","verticalAlign":"top","strokeColor":"#64748b","backgroundColor":"transparent","fillStyle":"solid","strokeWidth":1,"strokeStyle":"solid","roughness":0,"opacity":100,"angle":0,"seed":310048,"version":1,"versionNonce":1,"isDeleted":false,"groupIds":[],"boundElements":null,"link":null,"locked":false,"containerId":null,"lineHeight":1.45}
  ],
